---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import RevealHeading from '../components/RevealHeading.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Aura H2O"
  description="Aura H2O pulls water from the sky and bottles it in the backyard, with a standard atmospheric water generator. Premium cans and glass, ethical sponsors only, from Chapter 3 of the master plan."
  descriptor="Aura H2O"
>
  <main id="top">
    <section class="page-lead">
      <p class="story-kicker">From the sky</p>
      <RevealHeading as="h1">Aura H2O</RevealHeading>
      <p class="story-lede">
        Aura H2O pulls water from the sky and bottles it in the backyard. A standard atmospheric water generator is built into an Aura room, and the water goes into premium cans and glass bottles. Sponsors, when they arrive, will be ethical ones only.
      </p>
      <p class="story-lede">It is at the concept stage, like every Aura room. The waitlist is open, and no order is placed from this page.</p>
      <p class="later-actions">
        <a href="/master-plan">Read the master plan</a>
        <a href="/pre-order">Join the waitlist</a>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="later-hero">
      <img
        src="/media/video/water-line-poster.webp"
        alt="A quiet line inside an oak room, where water from the air will be held in glass."
        width="1920"
        height="1280"
      />
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
